# ML Prediction Platform

Locked stack: Python 3.11, scikit-learn, XGBoost, FastAPI on Railway, React+Vite+Tailwind on Vercel, Supabase for logs/metrics.

v1 tasks only: `house_price`, `churn`, `loan_default`. Column lists and metrics live in `src/config.py`.

- Save inference as `preprocess + model` joblib pipelines.
- Frontend calls FastAPI only (`VITE_API_BASE_URL`).
- If Supabase env vars are missing, fall back to local SQLite.
- Do not add auth, arbitrary-CSV AutoML, or extra tasks unless asked.
